// This section is for RUMORS in the game.
// THESE ONLY GET USED BY THE RUMOR OPCODE
// start at 20000
// rumors start at rumor number * 20
// the first message is the logbook message
// all others are filled in based on NPC's social class

{20020}{There are thieves on the northern outskirts of Black Root.}
{20021}{There's a nasty band of thieves on the northern outskirts of town.}

{20060}{Tugal is rumored to be a wizard.}
{20061}{Old Tugal is said to be a wizard, though no one knows for sure...}


//20400 - 20780 Shrouded Hills rumors (1020-1039)

{20400}{}
{20401}{Its said no one knows more about exotic objects than Ristezze the Importer.}

{20420}{}
{20421}{People say that Constable Owens is the expert on Shrouded Hills and its history.}

{20440}{}
{20441}{Its rumored that the Bridge out of town is held by brigands!}

{20460}{}
{20461}{Don't go out to the old Bessie Toone mine!  Its haunted!}

{20480}{}
{20481}{If you're in need of a good blacksmith, Lloyd Gurloes is the man to see.}

{20500}{}
{20501}{You hear what happened to that magick user that tried to throw his weight around here? Doc Roberts brought him down with a shot between the eyes!}

{20520}{}
{20521}{Old Jongle Dunne the hedgewizard has been acting weird.  Seems to have started just after Constabe Owens bought the old steam engine.}

{20540}{}
{20541}{There's been strange folk around here lately.  Been asking about the Panarii prophecies and what not.}

{20560}{}
{20561}{Constable Owens might strut around here like a spring rooster, but everyone knows that old Doc Roberts is the only real law in Shrouded Hills.}

{20580}{}
{20581}{You seen City Hall, yet?  Kinda fancy for a place like Shrouded Hills.  A long time ago, it was a Panarii Temple, but for some reason they stoppped using it.}

{20600}{}
{20601}{Have you seen our new bank here in town?  It made out of bricks!  Strong as a mule!  Everyone's keepin' their money in it!}

{20620}{}
{20621}{I saw Jacob Bens slouching around the Shrouded Hills Inn.  I don't trust that man one bit, I'll tell you...}

{20640}{}
{20641}{Have you heard about the ghost of Bessie Toone? Ever since she began haunting the mine, no good ore has come out of it. Her son Percival has been rather frantic about it as well.}

{20660}{}
{20661}{I hear that our local herbalist, Gaylin, is descended from a line of great elven healers.}


//20800 - 21380 Tarant rumors (1040-1069)
//(1040-1049 are through story state 6)
//(1040-1059 are through story state 13)
//(1040-1069 are through the last story state)

{20800}{}
{20801}{Have you met Mr. Cedric Appleby?  Laughing stock of the city, he is. Couldn't make a steam engine to save his life!}

{20820}{}
{20821}{Might be a good idea to lock up your valuables.  There's been a number of robberies in the city, mostly of precious art.}

{20840}{}
{20841}{Have you heard about P. Schuyler & Sons, the infamous jewelry dealers on Devonshire Way?  It's said that strange things go on behind their doors at night...}

{20860}{}
{20861}{Tarant is full of sooth-sayers trying to make a coin or two, but people say that Madame Toussaude can actually see the future!}

{20880}{}
{20881}{Do you follow the popular trends?  Old Elven artifacts are all the rage in Tarantian high society.}

{20900}{}
{20901}{If you're trying to find someone in Arcanum, try the Hall of Records here in Tarant.  They seem to know where a lot of people live...}

{20920}{}
{20921}{"All roads lead to Vermillion Station."  That's what they say, friend.  Biggest train station in all of Arcanum, it is.}

{20940}{}
{20941}{Did you hear?  Charles Dunston of the Tarantian Water and Power Plant has closed off some of the city's sewers for some reason.}

{20960}{}
{20961}{I hear Madam Lil runs quite an establishment down on the south side of town.}

{20980}{}
{20981}{The Wellington Gentlemen's Club is a nice place to go for a drink and good company, provided you enjoy the company of the richest men in Tarant.}

{21000}{}
{21001}{I think I heard someone say that Chairman Edward Willoughsby of the Tarantian Council is back in town.  I hear he was gone for quite a while...Caladon, I believe it was...}

{21020}{}
{21021}{Have you been over to the University?  It has some of the most learned professors in the land!}

{21040}{}
{21041}{Do you follow poiltics much, friend?  Well, it seems that Caladon is considering joining the Unified Kingdom!  Imagine that!}

{21060}{}
{21061}{Did you hear what's going on over at the factory at 15 Ten Hands Alley? The orcs have taken over! I hear that anarchist Donn Throgg is involved as well.}

{21080}{}
{21081}{Have you heard of Tarant's famous cat burglar?  I hear there's not a trap made that can keep him out!}


//21400 - 21780 Ashbury rumors (1070-1089)

{21400}{}
{21401}{I've heard that people have been seeing zombies around the graveyard.  I recommend you stay away.}

{21420}{}
{21421}{The whole town is in an uproar over the statue of Oliver Bettington.  It seems that everyone has a different opinion about how and where it should be built.}

{21440}{}
{21441}{Have you heard of the ancient shipwreck meant to be a short ways up the coast from here? Many have tried to find it, but few have returned from the attempt.}

{21460}{}
{21461}{Rumor has it that that old Malachi Rench's castle, up north Ashbury, is haunted. I'm not surprised, that old Malachi fellow was a weird one, they say.}

{21480}{}
{21481}{I heard an old adventurer passing through here the other day.  I don't know what he found, but I heard him mention these cooridinates: 617W, 528S.}

{21500}{}
{21501}{Have you met William Thorndop?  He is quite a strange one.  He must be a bit daft, to do what he's done to himself...}

{21520}{}
{21521}{Have you met Theo Brightstart?  I have never met another man who can throw as well as he!}

{21540}{}
{21541}{An old adventurer came through here last week.  He said that he found some old ruins to the northwest, beyond the Grey Mountains.  He said that in the ruins was an old altar made of solid gold!}

{21560}{}
{21561}{Have you run into Kendrick Wales here in Ashbury.  He's running around telling everyone that he's writing a book, but won't tell anyone what it's about!}

{21580}{}
{21581}{If you're in need of a skilled sea captain, Edward Teach is the man to see.}

{21600}{}
{21601}{If you happen to be over by the cemetery gates, steer clear of the wizard who's standing by them.  What a complete and utter snob!}

//21800 - 22180 Stillwater rumors (1090-1109)

{21800}{}
{21801}{Have you heard about Marley? Living in Stillwater must agree with him, he's become a sought after friend, and lover to the women. Strange, when no one used to like him at all....}

{21820}{}
{21821}{If you're looking for a good blade, there's no better man to buy it from than Richard Leeks, the town blacksmith.  He's a master swordsmith!}

{21840}{}
{21841}{Stillwater just hasn't been the same since the Cult of Geshtianna came into town.  If you're interested in finding out about them, you should talk to the priestess Brigitte.}

{21860}{}
{21861}{Old Cyrus the Wizard lives just northwest of town.  I haven't seen him around much, lately...}

{21880}{}
{21881}{If you're travelling the hills northwest of Stillwater, watch out for old Drog Balcktooth, the ogre.  He's mostly harmless, but you never know with ogres...}

{21900}{} 
{21901}{Have you heard about the Stillwater Giant?  It's an old legend here in Stillwater!  Everyone around here claims to have seen the creature once or twice...}

{21920}{}
{21921}{No one knows more about the Stillwater Giant than Stanley Hippington.  He lives in a small cottage, north of town.}

{21940}{}
{21941}{We don't have many elves here in Stillwater, but there's one named Myrth who lives here in town.  Fairly strange fellow, actually...}

{21960}{}
{21961}{If you really want to know what goes on around here, you should visit The Thirsty Soul.  It is the liveliest place in town.}

{21980}{}
{21981}{Have you heard about Adkin Chambers' tragic past?  To be crippled in such a way...that Stout fellow is truly barbaric!}

//22200 - 22580 Dernholm rumors (1110-1129)

{22200}{}
{22201}{Have you seen the Pits?  Not a whole lot in Dernholm, but we do have the Pits...they're a prison of sorts, and some of the most evil individuals have been put there.}

{22220}{}
{22221}{You didn't hear it from me, friend, but King Praetor wasn't the rightful heir to the throne.  And I'll say no more about that...}

{22240}{}
{22241}{Have you met Lianna Pel Dar, friend?  I wouldn't cross her, if I were you.  Her father trained her from birth to be a skilled warrior.}

{22260}{}
{22261}{Have you met Jayna Stiles?  Poor girl, living all alone the way she does.  And always studying her books...says she wants to be a healer!}

{22280}{}
{22281}{I saw Gladys crying about something she lost.}

{22300}{}
{22301}{I hear that the captain of the guard, "Sir" Garrick Stout, is a pompous, rude boar.  They say that his men fear him, but have no respect for him whatsoever!}

{22320}{}
{22321}{I was wandering northwest of here, and I found an ancient maze, or at least the ruins of one.  I heard some strange noises and got out of there quick!}

{22340}{}
{22341}{I don't know if you've been over to the Inn, but there's been a strange gnome hanging around by the bar for the past few days.}


//22600 - 22880 Tarant Thieves Underground rumors (1130-1144)

{22600}{}
{22601}{A small ship sank off Low Dervish Row.  It is said that there may be treasure hidden in the waters nearby.  I suspect it would fetch some fine coin on the black market.}

{22620}{}
{22621}{I hear that there is an enchanted looking glass hidden away in Mrs. Pettibone's home, over on Lungsten Road.  We have someone interested in obtaining such a remarkable item.}

{22640}{}
{22641}{Rumor has it that Mrs. Regina Halster, over on Devonshire, has received a special decanter of Napha Water.  It is said to be one of purest batches of elven perfume created in centuries.  The black market would welcome such a treasure.}

{22660}{}
{22661}{Rumor has it that Parnell's just got in some rare Essence of Will-o-the-Wisp.  It fetches quite a price on the secondary market.}

{22680}{}
{22681}{A patron of the Underground is interested in obtaining a vial of venom from the Lethe Wyvern.  Some say that the zoological society has such rarities in their stores.}

{22700}{}
{22701}{The Bates Factory has developed secret plans for a new weapon called Schreck's Multi-Barreled Pistol.  We have some buyers that are very interested in this new technology.}

{22720}{}
{22721}{I hear that one of the ships in port came laden with a store of flawless dwarven rubies.  We have a party interested in owning such perfection.}

{22740}{}
{22741}{It is said that one of the vagrant's over at Poone's has gotten hold of a lucky medallion.  There are many that would pay highly for such a trinket.}

{22760}{}
{22761}{Mr. Appleby has acquired a rare sword from the Derian Ka.  We have another collector that would like it for himself.}

{22780}{}
{22781}{Madam Lil keeps a particular music box on her person.  Someone we know is very interesting in getting hold of it.}

{22800}{}
{22801}{The Panarii temple has been gifted with the blessed Jewel of Hebe.  It has been set into a medallion and is said that he who wears it will be loved by all.  We have a buyer awaiting its arrival.}

{22820}{}
{22821}{It is rumored that Mr. Franklin keeps a ring on his person that enhances his virility.  A gift I'm sure many a man would pay greatly for.}

{22840}{}
{22841}{We hear Mr. Fitzgerald has gotten hold of a potion of the darkest power.  The underground does not feel it is safe with him and would prefer to care for it themselves.  He resides at 40 Polton Cross.}

{22860}{}
{22861}{Cassie keeps a very valuable collection of jewelry in the back room of Madam Lil's.  We know someone with a bit of a fetish for Cassie.  He's very interested in obtaining her jewelry.}

{22880}{}
{22881}{I hear some new kind of experimental engine, called The Heron Device, has been created.  It is said to be heavily guarded in a warehouse near the Bates Factory.  The underground wishes ownership of this device.}


//22900 - 23080 Caladon Thieves Underground rumors (1145-1154)

{22900}{}
{22901}{There is a couple staying at The Mushroom.  They've been overheard bragging about a family necklace with great powers.  The Underground is interested in obtaining it.}

{22920}{}
{22921}{Ryan Sanders carries a rare and valuable pocket watch on his person.  We have a party interested in obtaining this exquisite piece of technology.}

{22940}{}
{22941}{We have been notified that a ship has wrecked along the coast south of Caladon.  It is rumored to be carrying a large sum of gold.  If you can retrieve it before the authorities do, you will be richly rewarded.}

{22960}{}
{22961}{A secret armory is hidden beneath one of the guardhouses in Caladon.  If you can locate it, The Underground is interested in Caladon's Crusading Armor.}

{22980}{}
{22981}{A member of The Underground, Ryan Marshall, has compiled a rather extensive document on his crimes.  It is on file over at the police station.  We would like to obtain it for our own "safekeeping".}

{23000}{}
{23001}{The Underground is interested in the contents of the postal shipment bound for Tarant. It is awaiting a ship in the warehouse on the docks.}

{23020}{}
{23021}{Jonathan Sanders has a secret basement below his house.  It is rumored that he keeps a Staff of Restoration hidden there.  We have a party interested in obtaining this item.}

//23100 - 23480 Caladon rumors (1155-1174)

{23100}{}
{23101}{Have you heard of the Whytechurch Murderer the guards are looking for? He has us all quite scared around here, he does!}

{23120}{}
{23121}{Have you heard about the new castle defenses?  I hear the King is keeping Daniel MacPherson very busy ensuring everything is in tip top shape.}

{23140}{}
{23141}{I've heard the Thieves underground has quite an operation here in Caladon...}

{23160}{}
{23161}{Have you heard about Ryan Sanders?  Tsk, tsk...the selfish dandy spends his father's hard earned money as if there were no end to it!}

{23180}{}
{23181}{Have you met Adam Maxwell?  Rather a shady character, if you ask me.}

{23200}{}
{23201}{Have you heard of the werewolf?  Some say they have actually seen the beast prowling the outskirts of town late at night!}

{23220}{}
{23221}{Have you heard what happened to Maxim's factory? Thrashed about by some fools or other. No one knows why.}

{23240}{}
{23241}{I've heard that there's a pass through the Stonewall Mountains, somewhere north of here, that connects the southern halves of the continent.  The old adventurer who told me said that he saw a strange stone altar there as well...}

{23260}{}
{23261}{Have you seen the First Panarii Temple here in Caladon, friend?  It's a beautiful building...a place of sacred knowledge!}

{23280}{}
{23281}{Have you heard about Victor Misk, the book collector?  He's mentioned in that new book, "The Curse of T'sen-Ang"!  I guess it's quite a controversy!}

{23300}{}
{23301}{Heard anything about the Whytechurch Murders?  Terrible, just terrible.  But Inspector Henderson said he'll catch the murderer in no time...}

//23500 - 23680 Blackroot rumors (1175-1184)

{23500}{}
{23501}{If you're looking for a good place for ale, try the Sour Barnacle.  And the old sea dogs who drink there usually know what's going on...}

{23520}{}
{23521}{I hear that Herkemer Oggdoddler was one of Dernholm's finest soldiers back in his prime.  He is said to be highly trained in all of the necessary skills of war.}

{23540}{}
{23541}{Have you heard about poor Mrs. Cameron?  Her son has been missing for nearly a month and the poor thing is just beside herself with worry.}

{23560}{}
{23561}{Have you met Kietzel Pierce?   I hear he's the finest bowman in all of Arcanum.}

{23580}{}
{23581}{Have you spoken with Clarissa Shalmo?  I heard that she has discovered some ruins that may contain a powerful, ancient weapon.}

{23600}{}
{23601}{Black Root is the place to come to if you're looking to purchase yourself a boat, it is.}

{23620}{}
{23621}{Have you seen Killian Drake, down at the Sour Barnacle?  I've never seen a more luckier dice player in my life...}

{23640}{}
{23641}{Have you seen Seadrick? He off about something or other again.}

{23660}{}
{23661}{Black Root used to be under the protection of Cumbria, but I think the Mayor has other plans.}

{23680}{}
{23681}{Here in Black Root, it's said that no one makes better poisons than Grunwalde.}


//23700 - 24800 Roseborough rumors (1185-1194)

{23700}{}
{23701}{Rumor has it that there is a band of thieves hiding in the mountains near here. They were meant to have been involved in a robbery at the Inn.}

{23720}{}
{23721}{Have you been to the Ring of Brodgar?  It's just northwest of here.  They say it's thousands of years old...something to do with magick...}

{23740}{}
{23741}{I hear that the Roseborough Inn is the finest in all the land.}

{23760}{}
{23761}{Have you heard of poor Mrs. Morgan's predicament?  Her thieving son received a life sentence in Caladon's high security prison.  The fool actually tried to break into the castle!}

{23780}{}
{23781}{Have you noticed the stranger that moved into town recently?  He is certainly a rude man!}

{23800}{}
{23801}{Have you met Jason C. Guy?  He has been spending a tremendous amount of time studying the Ring of Brodgar...quite an odd fellow.}

{23820}{}
{23821}{Can you believe it?  Someone actually said they glimpsed a lethe wyvern roaming the countryside north of town.  What rubbish!}

{23840}{}
{23841}{I heard an old merchant in the tavern the other night...he was talking about a strange lagoon he's seen on his way down from the Glimmering.  It's directly north of here, along the coast...not that I'd go anywhere near it, mind you!}

{23860}{}
{23861}{I'm not one for evil stories, but a friend of a friend told me of this evil place, northeast of here...says its cold, even in the summer time, and smells of old, dark magicks.  Gives me the shivers just thinking about it!}

{23880}{}
{23881}{I've heard that someone has been digging up graves in the Roseborough cemetery.}

//23900 - 24500 Wheel Clan rumors (1195-1225)

{23900}{}
{23901}{If you want to know about the Dredge, talk to Vegard Moltenflow.  He used to work in those old mines before they closed them down...}

{23920}{}
{23921}{We dwarves don't put much stock in books and the like, but it seems that they're the only thing that Erick Obsidian cares about.  Calls himself a "historian", I think...}

{23940}{}
{23941}{Someone told me that Thrayne Iron Heart is looking for his brother Erland...}

{23960}{}
{23961}{I'd stay out of the ore mines if I were you, friend.  The miners down there say that something evil has been unleashed down there, and more than a few men have gone missing...}

{23980}{}
{23981}{You didn't hear it from me, friend, but no one has seen the true king, Loghaire Thunder Stone, for many years.  No one knows why, either.}

{24000}{}
{24001}{I sure am worried about Thorvald Two Stones.  We haven't seen him around here for almost 200 years!  I'm afraid he might be lost...}

{24020}{}
{24021}{If you're looking to make an offering to Alberich, friend, the altar is located in the Royal Grounds.}

{24040}{}
{24041}{Not that I get out much, but I've heard tell that there's a strange old bog just northwest of here, over the mountains.  Who knows what might be there?}
